@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginAdv

# Scene2-ex5

; 建物が揺れる地震の音
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Ambi_7_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:13_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_12_1_Loop IntroBgmPath:Bgm_12_1_Intro Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:——整座监狱岛都被亚里沙的魔法火焰吞噬，<br>并在汉娜的魔法作用下，飞向高空。|#CommonBad11_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:剧烈的震动和地鸣声响彻四周。|#CommonBad11_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:飘浮到空中的监狱岛，<br>因无法承受自身重量而开始崩溃。|#CommonBad11_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:40 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL7,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Pensive_Open01,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Confused_Middle,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
[PrintTextModified Text:希罗……|#CommonBad11_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛一脸不安地看着我，<br>我无言地轻轻握住了她的手。|#CommonBad11_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我最终还是没能阻止堕落为魔女、<br>失去控制的少女——|#CommonBad11_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.12
[PrintTextModified Text:对不起……|#CommonBad11_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我再也做不到任何事，只能说出这样的话。|#CommonBad11_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor
; ========================================

; ========================================
; 建物が揺れる地震の音
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Ambi_7_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
; ========================================

[PrintTextModified Text:不久，审判庭崩塌了，强烈的失重感向我袭来。<br>紧接着，我失去了意识——|#CommonBad11_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]
@StopBgm
@Wait WaitMode:1.0

; ========================================
; 時間経過
; ========================================

; ========================================
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#ffffff Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor
; ========================================

[PrintTextModified Text:监狱岛崩溃了，<br>被牵涉其中的少女们下落不明。|#CommonBad11_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; @char Warden.9 pos:50
[PrintTextModified Text:这下有点麻烦了啊。|#CommonBad11_Warden001| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; @char Warden.1 pos:50
[PrintTextModified Text:唉，不过是死是活，<br>倒也无所谓了……|#CommonBad11_Warden002| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:无论是拥有魔女因子的人，<br>还是已经化为魔女的人，<br>都不能放任其在外界自由行动。|#CommonBad11_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:必须找到她们，对其施加适当的处置。<br>仅此而已。|#CommonBad11_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

